  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Government Debt &amp; Infrastructure Finance -Paraguay IFT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OTA is assisting in strengthening the institutional capacity of the Finance Ministry and other relevant agencies in the formulation, appraisal, structuring and negotiation of infrastructure projects using the Public-Private Partnership model. It is also providing TA for strengthening the Ministry&apos;s risk analysis capacity and developing procedures for the identification and management of contingent liabilities arising from these projects.</narrative>
  </description>
